<span class="cs-line">    r2 = <span class="fn">r2_score</span>(h, h_pred)</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g">    <span class="kw">return</span> r2  <span class="cmt"># 1.0 = perfect recovery</span></span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Key insight: linear probing tests this!</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># If R²=1, probes work exactly.</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># If R²&lt;1, probes fail on new tasks.</span>
